; A bucket account completes only a transaction with exactly one posting
; (src/xact.cc, xact_base_t::finalize: "posts.size() == 1"), and a
; paren-virtual posting counts.  One real posting beside it is therefore
; not completed, and its residual is rejected.

bucket Assets:Cash

2024/01/01 Real posting with a paren-virtual posting
    Expenses:Food     $10
    (Budget:Food)    $-10

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
While balancing transaction from "$FILE", lines 8-10:
> 2024/01/01 Real posting with a paren-virtual posting
>     Expenses:Food     $10
>     (Budget:Food)    $-10
Unbalanced remainder is:
                 $10
Amount to balance against:
                 $10
Error: Transaction does not balance
end test
